      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GLOBAL ARK (2) was responsible for a very good effort last time over 2242m at Narrogin, finishing third and just 1.1 metres from the winner. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role. NELLYS WORLD (6) finished second last start over 2100m at Bunbury, beaten 6 metres. That was an improvement on the unplaced effort at this track the run before. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run but might need things to go her way at some stage. Good enough to take out a race like this. ZILLIONAIRE (1) is in the mix following a fourth at her most recent appearance over 2130m at Gloucester Park. PRICEOFADMISSION (8) is worth some thought after her last-start fourth when resuming over 2100m at Bunbury on November 13.",
